## Prerequisites

- Azure subscription with Owner or Contributor access
- Snowflake account on Azure (same region as Azure resources)
- Snowflake ACCOUNTADMIN role

---

## Step 1: ADLS Gen2 Setup

### 1.1 Create Resource Group
```
Portal → Resource Groups → + Create
  Name:    iceberg-poc-rg
  Region:  East US 2 (or your preferred region)
```

### 1.2 Create Storage Account
```
Portal → Storage accounts → + Create
  Resource Group:           iceberg-poc-rg
  Storage account name:     adlsicebergpoc
  Region:                   East US 2
  Performance:              Standard
  Redundancy:               LRS

Advanced tab:
  Enable hierarchical namespace: ✅  ← CRITICAL for ADLS Gen2
```

### 1.3 Create Container
```
Storage account → Containers → + Container
  Name:             iceberg-warehouse
  Anonymous access: Private
```

