## Troubleshooting Reference

### Azure IAM Issues

| Error | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `AuthorizationPermissionMismatch` | Wrong role type | Use `Storage Blob Data *` roles not `Contributor` |
| `LinkedAuthorizationFailed` | Missing Storage Account Contributor | Add role on storage account |
| `InvalidSubscriptionId: resourceGroups` | EventGrid role at wrong scope | Assign EventGrid role at **Subscription** level |
| `ContainerNotFound 404` | Container doesn't exist | Create `iceberg-warehouse` container in ADLS |
| `AuthorizationFailure 403` | Missing Storage Queue role | Add `Storage Queue Data Contributor` |

### Snowflake External Volume Issues

| Error | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `AuthorizationPermissionMismatch 403` | Missing Blob Delegator role | Add `Storage Blob Delegator` to Snowflake identity |
| `ContainerNotFound 404` | Container missing or wrong name | Create container / check URL spelling |
| `LinkedAuthorizationFailed` | Missing write permission | Change Reader to Contributor for Snowflake identity |
| Managed identity not found in IAM | Consent URL not accepted | Open AZURE_CONSENT_URL in browser and Accept |

### Databricks Issues

| Error | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| Libraries tab not visible | Need to create cluster first | Create cluster then add libs from cluster detail page |
| Serverless — no JAR support | Serverless limitation | Use classic cluster for Spark connector |
| File Events validation failed | EventGrid permissions | Skip validation in Advanced options for POC |

